  "summary": "Worldsemi WS2812B-V5 addressable RGB LED in a 5.0 x 5.0 mm 5050 package. Draws 0.6 mA idle and 12 mA per channel (36.6 mA at full white), latches 24-bit GRB colour on DIN and passes the rest to DOUT.",
